  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Back to Bassom**: back after 130 archived shows (1557 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [8]\n- **Leave Deener Alone**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n- **Take a look At Me Now**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n- **Booze me Up and get me High**: back after 38 archived shows (749 days) [8]\n- **Puert Rican Power**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [8]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2005-11-28.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 44 songs; 218 min; rated 4.67/5 by 6 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer calls it an excellent recording, considering how rowdy the crowd was; Reviewer says recording quality isn't the best but is still worth downloading [5][6]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended and describes the crowd as wild that evening [5]\n- The band played for about three hours and forty-five minutes, with no weak stretches according to the reviewer [6]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2005-11-28.flac**: taped by Robbie Frazelle; transferred by kliked; source: mxl 993's -> w-mod ua-5 -> jb3 [1]. Also: Reviewer says the recording came from the only taper at the show; Reviewer, who attended, noticed the taper set up with just a single microphone stand [5][6]",
